        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Alden Robinson, David Nixon, Bob Clark, Sylvester Stallone, Dolly Parton\n- Works: Field of Dreams, Sneakers, The Sum of All Fears, Rhinestone, Tennessee Homesick Blues\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, film producer, songwriter, recording artist\n\nFacts:\n- Phil Alden Robinson was born on March 1, 1950, and he is an American film director and screenwriter.\n- Phil Alden Robinson's films include Field of Dreams, Sneakers, and The Sum of All Fears.\n- Rhinestone is a 1984 American musical comedy film directed by Bob Clark.\n- Rhinestone was written by Sylvester Stallone and Phil Alden Robinson.\n- Rhinestone stars Sylvester Stallone and Dolly Parton.\n- Tennessee Homesick Blues is a song written and recorded by Dolly Parton.\n- Tennessee Homesick Blues was featured on the soundtrack of the 1984 film Rhinestone.\n- David Nixon is an American film director and film producer.",
